4+ claim. The WASM route must compile public/cloud-crush.wasm, copy source assets into public/assets, and use the matching Go wasm_exec.js; the current public asset directory is incomplete. Cloud deployment is optional. The creator’s generation claim is distinct from independent code-authorship verification.","limitations","源码提供的内容","Complete game project: main.go contains rendering, match rules, input, game states, audio, and scores; assets/ is committed. Includes go.mod, server/main.go, public/index.html, wasm_exec.js, Dockerfile, and publisher gameplay screenshots. Native run: go run .; the case guide also records the browser build and asset-copy steps.","codeScope","代码类型","实现代码","codeType","links","参考资料","items",[86],"evidenceUrl",{"_55":82,"_25":87},"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/devrel-demos/blob/main/codelabs/gemini-cli/gemini-cli-match3-golang/README.md","代码与使用说明",[91],"codeUrl",{"_55":88,"_25":92},"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/devrel-demos/tree/main/codelabs/gemini-cli/gemini-cli-match3-golang","主要来源",[96],"sourceUrl",{"_55":93,"_25":97},"https://codelabs.developers.google.com/next26/gemini-cli-match3-golang","引擎与运行环境","Ebitengine 2 · Go · WebAssembly","engine","list","客户端与模型归属","ordered",false,[107],"agents","Gemini CLI","工具类别","可运行的游戏代码","lead","summary","code-example",[116],true,"implementation","gemini-cli",{"_118":119},"documents",{"_64":120,"_35":121},[123,127,128,129,126,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,125,162,124,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183],[122,123,124,125,126],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","